# ⛔ 6.7.17 — a whole field or method chain on any receiver head binds as the struct value it is (the user's D2,
# 2026-10-22): `sz(w.p)`, `sz(b.mp2())`, `sz(w.gp().m())`, `sz((*pw).p)` — `_acv_bind` (parse/decl.cyr). CHANGELOG [6.7.17]
fn _ic_arg(S, fi, a, k): i64 {
